Politeness is artificial good humor.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:14.680
Thomas Jefferson, in room three, time is of the essence.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.830
- Whoa, who's Mr. Personality?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.830
- Harry Radich, proud member of the Disease of the Month Club.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:22.810
