00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.450
He has a remarkable recovery rate.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.140
So, Harry, what seems to be the problem today?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:42.060
I'm hoping you'll tell me it's all in my mind.

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.550
That's a big step for you, Harry.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:47.240
Why don't you tell me your symptoms?

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.720
Words don't do them justice.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.990
You seem to have ruptured a blood vessel in your sclera.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:08.900
Have you had any trauma to the eye?

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:15.740
Unfortunately, my eye is only the tip of the iceberg.

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:20.030
What are you doing?

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:20.930
Look at that.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:26.110
It's another symptom.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.620
