00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.000
Okay, okay.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.700
We're gonna get this bleeding under control.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.740
In the meantime, I'm gonna run some tests.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:40.820
- Okay, but wait, you haven't even seen the worst of it.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:04.480
Dr. Leslie Coburn has always treated Harry with a placebo,

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:08.550
an imaginary cure for his imaginary illnesses.

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:13.640
But what will this young doctor do when her patient contracts a real disease?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:17.190
A disease found only in the Twilight Zone.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.640
We're traveling to another dimension.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:26.020
Dimension not only of sight and sound.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:36.210
Boundaries are only that of the imagination.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:40.950
You're entering.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:50.960
Very strange.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.700
This makes no sense.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.630
First, I thought it was a blood disorder, maybe ITP.

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:05.330
Platelet count?

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.050
That's the thing.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:09.310
His platelet count's high, but his progromentine and PTT are both low.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.650
He shouldn't have a clotting problem.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:11.650
Patient history?

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:14.060
Well, actually, it's Harry Radditch.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.280
Lastly, what do we know about hypochondriacs?

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.540
This time, he's exhibiting symptoms.

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.200
Treat the mind, not the body.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.870
I know, but aside from the blood anomaly, he's got some very unusual skin masses.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.890
Biopsy hasn't revealed anything, but...

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:30.000
Probably just a psychosomatic manifestation, my advisor.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.670
to a psychiatrist.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.010
Leslie's gonna take my patients

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.890
while I'm at the AMA luncheon.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.510
- But isn't it possible

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:38.610
