00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.420
- It's possible, but it's not probable.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.160
Tell you what makes you feel any better,

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.110
get some more tests.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.880
- How is it?

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.590
- I gave him the Dysmoproxen, like you said,

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.970
but his bleeding hasn't stopped

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.240
and his temperature's up to 101.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.990
But honestly, it's his attitude

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.160
that's gonna get him killed.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:05.200
