00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:48.090
Budapest, Mozambique, Zanzibar.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:51.670
I was always afraid of picking up some rare disease.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.210
You know what the sad fact is?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.640
I rarely leave my house anymore.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:00.000
Mrs. Mendelssohn, my housekeeper, she even

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.760
Does all my shopping for me.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:04.810
Oh, no.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.180
Mrs. Mendelsohn.

